      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on this new crime thriller and I'm stuck on the setting. I need a really dark, atmospheric description of a part of the city that's just... bad. Like, a neighborhood where you instantly feel like you shouldn't be there. Make it feel sketchy and dangerous, maybe describe the vibe of the streets and the types of people hanging around that you'd see in the local news reports about crime. Just give me a gritty paragraph to set the mood.",
