      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, really sets the mood. I want to get a bit more specific with the characters to make it feel real though. When the protagonist is walking through there, I want them to feel tension from the people on the street. Can you describe a few specific groups or individuals they might pass? I'm looking for those specific 'types' of people that make a neighborhood feel like it's controlled by a certain element—you know, the kind of people who look like they're part of the local crime scene or the street life that usually ends up on the evening news.",
      "source": "evaluator"
